{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50933","headline":"村径中即事 · 吕从庆","name":"村径中即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂剪茅檐外，溪流曲似绳。\n飞蜓低复仰，啼鸟断还仍。\n麦秀香联亩，麻高影障塍。\n老夫无病痛，长此乐清礽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕从庆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50933.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50933","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}